   "text": "Ranking: top 3 as podium cards\nwith sprites, the rest as compact\nbars. Re-rank = layout animation,\n240ms ease-in-out, transform only.\nA row crossing into the podium\nswaps card/row in place (crossfade).",
   "originalText": "Ranking: top 3 as podium cards\nwith sprites, the rest as compact\nbars. Re-rank = layout animation,\n240ms ease-in-out, transform only.\nA row crossing into the podium\nswaps card/row in place (crossfade).",
